em pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Honkfoot.\" title=\"Old Honkfoot.\">Old Honkfoot.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg.\" title=\"Schrödinger&#39;s egg.\">Schrödinger's egg.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>It's my milk now.</b></i> is the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_15\" title=\"Series 15\">Series 15</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 4 May 2023. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Mae_Martin\" title=\"Mae Martin\">Mae Martin</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/It%27s_my_milk_now.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ivo_Graham\" title=\"Ivo Graham\">Ivo Graham</a> told <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> \"It's my milk now\", during the <a href=\"/wiki/Bash_the_big_bell_with_the_bowling_ball\" title=\"Bash the big bell with the bowling ball\">Bash the big bell with the bowling ball</a> task. The title card is of an egg carton set on fire, with the eggs referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Efficiently_shell_an_egg\" title=\"Efficiently shell an egg\">Efficiently shell an egg</a> task. The egg carton being on fire may be a reference to <a href=\"/wiki/Frankie_Boyle\" title=\"Frankie Boyle\">Frankie Boyle</a>'s attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Invent_an_imaginary_companion\" title=\"Invent an imaginary companion\">Invent an imaginary companion</a> task.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/It%27s_my_milk_now.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Nu er det min mæk', which translates as 'Now it's my milk'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Se on nyt minun maitoni', which translates as 'It's my milk now'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Nå er det min melk', which translates as 'Now it's my milk'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/It%27s_my_milk_now.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Frankie_Boyle\" title=\"Frankie Boyle\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Frankie Boyle</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ivo_Graham\" title=\"Ivo Graham\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ivo Graham</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jenny_Eclair\" title=\"Jenny Eclair\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jenny Eclair</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Kiell_Smith-Bynoe\" title=\"Kiell Smith-Bynoe\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Kiell Smith-Bynoe</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mae_Martin\" title=\"Mae Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mae Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_to_play_about_with_in_your_bathroom\" title=\"Best thing to play about with in your bathroom\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing to play about with in your bathroom.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Invent_an_imaginary_companion\" title=\"Invent an imaginary companion\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Invent an imaginary companion, then complete a domestic task with your imaginary companion. Your imaginary companion must either be much taller or much littler than you.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Efficiently_shell_an_egg\" title=\"Efficiently shell an egg\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Efficiently shell an egg. You may not touch any part of any egg with your hands and you may only break the shell of one of the eggs.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bash_the_big_bell_with_the_bowling_ball\" title=\"Bash the big bell with the bowling ball\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Bash the big bell with the bowling ball. Fastest gets five points. Slowest gets four points. Nobody else gets any points. You must stay off the grass unless you are wearing gold shoes. If anything other than the bowling ball or gold shoes touches the grass, you are disqualified.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Walk_around_the_chairs_listening_to_Greg%27s_story\" title=\"Walk around the chairs listening to Greg&#39;s story\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Walk around the chairs listening to Greg's story, then sit on a chair when you hear a word containing two letter Ls. If you stop walking or touch a chair incorrectly, you are disqualified. If you fail to sit on a chair when you hear a word containing two letter Ls, you are disqualified.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">21\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/It%27s_my_milk_now.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\